From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MiSTer H264 core <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 20:59:20 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] MiSTer: a static build without avahi, libuuid or libudev

Discovery is compiled out (the host is named); libuuid is replaced by a random UUID from OpenSSL;
udev's hotplug is replaced by an inotify watch on /dev/input. libgamestream and
moonlight-common are static libraries. For the MiSTer H264 core's Moonlight client
(docs/moonlight.md in that repository).
